# Harmat — a drizzle-like query builder for Kex.
#
# Declare tables once (table-first schema DSL generating row records),
# build typed queries that collapse to static text at compile time,
# run them through one ODBC boundary (Harmat.Database) that reaches
# SQLite and PostgreSQL alike, and keep the schema current with
# Harmat.Migration. Nullable columns are Optional and only spell
# IS NULL; `= NULL` is inexpressible.
module Harmat do
  export Harmat.Schema
  export Harmat.Query
  export Harmat.Database
  export Harmat.Migration
  export Harmat.Table
  export Harmat.Repository
end
